  "description": "Joo-Hyuk has spent a lifetime at the bottom of the societal food chain as a recessive alpha. That hasn’t stopped him from maintaining a peculiar relationship with the dominant omega at the top of the food chain, Yoo-Sung. For ten years, Joo-Hyuk finds himself longing for Yoo-Sung, who only comes to him when he needs to hide away from the world for a night. After spending ten years as Yoo-sung’s occasional sanctuary, Joo-Hyuk, sick of his one-sided pining, puts an end to their arrangement. But are they really destined to end there? Or is there something written in the stars for them? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes ten extra chapters.*",
